      "role": "user",
      "content": "the stillness feels more like a void than peace. i'm just so tired of fighting to stay attached to a world that feels like it's made of smoke. everything i try to hold onto just slips through my fingers. it feels like i'm just supposed to eventually dissolve into it, you know? like there's no point in trying to be a person anymore.",
